sequenceDiagram
 participant F as Field User
 participant M as Mobile App
 participant A as API
 participant V as Validation/Post Engine
 participant T as Digital Twin
 participant P as Project Manager
 F->>M: Capture labor, equipment, production, weather, photos
 M->>A: Sync signed payload
 A->>V: Authorize and validate
 V-->>M: Conflict or validation response
 V->>T: Post approved operational facts
 T->>P: Refresh health, cost, schedule, and alerts
